38","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment40:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment40","raw_text":"红方平车加紧攻势，既攻象又遮车，黑飞象被迫，如车4平5，则兵五进一，下一着车二平三，黑难应付。","text":"红方平车加紧攻势，既攻象又遮车，黑飞象被迫，如车4平5，则兵五进一，下一着车二平三，黑难应付。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":40,"anchor_node_id":"0:40","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment43:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment43","raw_text":"不急于沉底而先驱车，次序好，巧妙的构成天地炮杀势。","text":"不急于沉底而先驱车，次序好，巧妙的构成天地炮杀势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":43,"anchor_node_id":"0:43","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment47:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment47","raw_text":"红胜。||至此，黑虽拥有重兵，却难挽败势。以下如：（1）车4平2，车七进二，车2退1，炮五退二，红亦胜。||（2）车4退1，车二进二，车4平5，车七进一，象5进3，车七平六，再车二平五杀。","text":"红胜。\n至此，黑虽拥有重兵，却难挽败势。以下如：（1）车4平2，车七进二，车2退1，炮五退二，红亦胜。\n（2）车4退1，车二进二，车4平5，车七进一，象5进3，车七平六，再车二平五杀。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":47,"anchor_node_id":"0:47","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["广东许银川 先胜 湖北熊学元"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第一章 中炮对屏风马类（56局）"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["C73 五七炮互进三兵对屏风马边卒右马外盘河"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"]},"source_tag_count":15,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":47,"legal_move_records":47,"annotations":7,"annotation_statuses":{"attached":7}},"memberships":[{"book_id":"yl-book-66","category_id":"66","title":"第一章 中炮对屏风马类 广东许银川 先胜 湖北熊学元","catalogue_order":45,"directory_url":"https://m.xiangqiqipu.com/Category/List-66-2.html"}],"book_ids":["yl-book-66"]}}
